#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:5
msgid "Conductor settings"
msgstr "导体设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option to storage at the Data from the application"
" some `project properties`_ pre-defined by the user. This feature allows the"
" user avoiding to define many `project properties`_ each time that the user "
"`creates new projects`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了将用户预定义的一些 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ "
"存储到应用程序数据中的选项。此功能让用户每次 `创建新项目 <creates new projects_>`_ 时，无需重复定义大量 `项目属性 "
"<project properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:11
msgid ""
"The **Conductor** tab from **New project** settings section allows pre-"
"defining some `conductor properties`_:"
msgstr "**新项目** 设置部分中的 **导体** 标签页允许预先定义一些 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ ："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:13
msgid "`Conductor type`_ (`Multiline`_ or `Single line`_)."
msgstr ""
"`导体类型 <Conductor type_>`_ （ `多线 <Multiline_>`_ 或 `单线 <Single line_>`_ ）。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:14
msgid "`Conductor appearance`_."
msgstr "`导体外观 <Conductor appearance_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech New project conductor settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 新项目导体设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:21
msgid "To define conductor settings:"
msgstr "要定义导体设置："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:23
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech 设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:24
msgid "Go to **New project** section."
msgstr "转到 **新项目** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:25
msgid "Go to **Conductor** tab."
msgstr "转到 **导体** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:26
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "为每个字段设置所需的参数。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:27
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close settings "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改并关闭设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/conductor_settings.rst:31
msgid ""
"All pre-defined conductor properties defined at QElectroTech settings PopUP "
"window will be automatically defined during `project creation`_ at `project "
"properties`_. The `conductor properties`_ can be found at `Conductor tab`_ "
"from `New folio`_ section."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 设置弹出窗口中预定义的所有导体属性，都会在 `项目创建 <project creation_>`_ 时自动填入 `项目属性"
" <project properties_>`_ 。 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ 可在 `新建图幅 <New "
"folio_>`_ 部分的 `导体标签页 <Conductor tab_>`_ 中找到。"
